-And the other widows?

270
00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:08.062
-Right.
-Right. No. I don't think so.

271
00:19:08.246 --> 00:19:12.346
I actually think it's probably more like possession.

272
00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:13.729
Possession?

273
00:19:15.096 --> 00:19:16.822
Like a ghost or a demon.

274
00:19:17.095 --> 00:19:18.663
- Man.
