00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.604
Guys. guys. guys!
I can't take my mask off. I'm...

315
00:21:32.731 --> 00:21:33.857
Spider-Man.

316
00:21:34.974 --> 00:21:36.267
He's all right. At ease.

317
00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:43.125
My apologies.

318
00:21:43.521 --> 00:21:44.641
We are so glad you're here.

319
00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:47.875
Bill Metzger. Director of Damage Control.
How are you?

320
00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:49.208
I'm good. thank you.

321
