324
00:21:58.985 --> 00:22:02.425
Downstairs. we have incident cleanup. laboratories. agent training.

325
00:22:04.060 --> 00:22:05.985
-Hey. what are they doing here?
-It's okay.

326
00:22:06.712 --> 00:22:08.300
The Hand works for us now.

327
00:22:08.839 --> 00:22:10.426
After you brought them in. I realized that...

328
00:22:10.666 --> 00:22:13.103
