332
00:22:25.200 --> 00:22:27.925
You can look at the many threats that face us and see only danger.

333
00:22:29.302 --> 00:22:30.600
Or you can see opportunity.

334
00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:33.526
Okay.

335
00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:39.264
Wow. look at that.

336
00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:42.325
In the hands of Shocker.
these are a nuisance.

337
00:22:44.385 --> 00:22:45.862
