353
00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:37.636
Someone or something that can hop into people's minds.

354
00:23:38.634 --> 00:23:39.621
But not yours.

355
00:23:39.953 --> 00:23:42.503
No. I mean. it tried. but it couldn't.

356
00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:52.967
I'm gonna be honest with you.

357
00:23:53.800 --> 00:23:55.402
We're on our heels right now.

358
00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:58.850
God forbid if it were to get in here and find whatever it is it's looking for...

359
