363
00:24:15.766 --> 00:24:18.391
But I believe you are our best defense against this.

364
00:24:18.526 --> 00:24:20.186
You're the only one who can sense it.

365
00:24:20.600 --> 00:24:22.281
You're the only one who's immune to it.

366
00:24:22.542 --> 00:24:24.229
I'm counting on you to defeat it.

367
00:24:27.683 --> 00:24:29.778
That's a pretty good speech. Director.

368
00:24:30.600 --> 00:24:32.453
I'll do everything that I can. I promise.

369
00:24:33.608 --> 00:24:35.665
Well. then consider yourself a friend of Damage Control.

370
00:24:36.213 --> 00:24:37.532
Thank you.

371
00:24:38.126 --> 00:24:39.480
