384
00:25:13.307 --> 00:25:16.531
That sounds super illegal. Spider-Man.
I'mma pretend I didn't hear that.

385
00:25:16.719 --> 00:25:19.688
Yeah. probably for the best.
But look. if he shows his face. we'll know.

386
00:25:19.800 --> 00:25:21.208
Do you have any mini-kegs?

387
00:25:22.079 --> 00:25:23.229
Down at the end.

388
00:25:23.312 --> 00:25:24.442
Thanks.

389
00:25:27.567 --> 00:25:28.836
