1057
01:11:35.866 --> 01:11:40.110
So if I could get it on Jean.
it should completely shut down her powers.

1058
01:11:41.099 --> 01:11:42.452
You know what else would work?

1059
01:11:42.766 --> 01:11:44.216
You just shoot her.

1060
01:11:44.393 --> 01:11:45.365
Nice.

1061
01:11:48.266 --> 01:11:49.268
Jesus Christ.

1062
01:11:50.784 --> 01:11:53.034
That has gotta be the goofiest shit I ever seen in my life.

1063
01:11:53.086 --> 01:11:56.252
What. you can't even take the mask off to drink a cup of coffee?

1064
01:11:57.400 --> 01:12:00.647
