It stays on for everybody.

1065
01:12:01.400 --> 01:12:02.729
Even her?

1066
01:12:05.000 --> 01:12:06.083
Who is she. kid?

1067
01:12:06.566 --> 01:12:07.216
I don't know.

1068
01:12:07.302 --> 01:12:09.022
That's horseshit. Who is she?

1069
01:12:09.400 --> 01:12:11.536
-I'm telling you. I don't know who she is.
-What are you doin'? You care about her.

1070
01:12:11.800 --> 01:12:12.910
-You're pretending not to. Why?
-I don't care about her.

1071
01:12:13.000 --> 01:12:14.776
Look. I don't know who she is. Frank. Okay?

1072
01:12:15.000 --> 01:12:17.629
I don't have anybody. I'm like you.
I just keep to myself.

1073
01:12:17.800 --> 01:12:19.159
You're like me?

1074
01:12:20.200 --> 01:12:21.639
What do you know about me. kid?

1075
01:12:22.600 --> 01:12:23.854
You think this is a choice?

1076
01:12:23.879 --> 01:12:26.508
Living like this. it's a lifestyle? Is that what you think?

1077
01:12:27.166 --> 01:12:28.930
Kid. this is a sentence.

1078
01:12:29.782 --> 01:12:30.996
You know somethin'...

1079
01:12:31.579 --> 01:12:33.144
If I had one second...

1080
01:12:34.033 --> 01:12:37.316
people I love were still breathing.
you think I'd be hiding behind a mask?

1081
01:12:37.800 --> 01:12:40.033
You think I'd pretend to be something that I'm not...

1082
01:12:40.159 --> 01:12:42.281
acting like a goddamn coward?

1083
01:12:47.459 --> 01:12:49.204
I got a facial match

1084
01:12:53.000 --> 01:12:55.044
She's at the Damage Control HQ in Manhattan.

1085
01:12:55.126 --> 01:12:56.524
I gotta go. Okay.

1086
01:13:00.790 --> 01:13:02.397
She's gonna be okay.

1087
01:13:03.057 --> 01:13:04.464
I'll see to it.

1088
01:13:07.205 --> 01:13:08.565
Thanks. Frank.

1089
01:13:15.009 --> 01:13:16.276
Hey.

1090
