1108
01:15:56.886 --> 01:15:59.636
You know. you and Banner have a lot in common.

1109
01:15:59.720 --> 01:16:04.263
Both fighting a losing battle against the monster that lives inside you.

1110
01:16:04.496 --> 01:16:06.243
Jean. this is the Hulk. you can't just...

1111
01:16:14.838 --> 01:16:16.051
What the hell?

1112
