1115
01:16:26.135 --> 01:16:28.270
Whatever V-Max is. you're not getting it.

1116
01:16:28.666 --> 01:16:30.060
Like hell I'm not.

1117
01:16:30.460 --> 01:16:31.686
Crap.

1118
