1131
01:18:27.932 --> 01:18:29.654
Wait. did she actually say that to you?

1132
01:18:30.513 --> 01:18:32.173
Are you blushing. daffodil?

1133
01:18:32.600 --> 01:18:33.881
I'm not blushing.

1134
01:18:35.653 --> 01:18:38.202
Goddamn it.
I knew I should have brought a bigger gun.

1135
01:18:38.344 --> 01:18:39.617
That's a good idea. "Bring a bigger gun.

1136
01:18:39.800 --> 01:18:40.800
