Don't start with that soft serve bullshit.

1148
01:19:04.200 --> 01:19:06.050
You know something? I'm gonna do this. I'm gonna do it my way.

1149
01:19:06.212 --> 01:19:08.550
Just... just go. just go.

1150
01:19:08.707 --> 01:19:10.337
