-Did I hurt anyone?

1161
01:19:54.579 --> 01:19:56.800
It's not your fault. She was in your mind.
You weren't in control.

1162
01:19:57.000 --> 01:19:58.950
-I lost my inhibitor.
-Look here. here.

1163
01:19:59.000 --> 01:20:01.133
It's the only thing keeping the monster inside.

1164
01:20:01.306 --> 01:20:02.999
It's okay. I got another one here.
I just need you to put this on.

1165
01:20:03.292 --> 01:20:04.950
-What is it?
-It's universal.

1166
01:20:05.067 --> 01:20:06.232
It should work on you.

1167
01:20:16.007 --> 01:20:18.419
Please. sir. there's people in the building.
Just put it on.

1168
01:20:21.958 --> 01:20:22.975
You okay?

1169
01:20:23.000 --> 01:20:26.130
My head. I think she broke something!

1170
01:20:26.330 --> 01:20:27.750
Is she still in there?

1171
01:20:27.800 --> 01:20:28.950
No.

1172
01:20:29.000 --> 01:20:30.220
