1173
01:20:30.600 --> 01:20:33.250
Bruce? Look. I can get you out of here. okay?

1174
01:20:33.400 --> 01:20:34.950
I just need you to put that inhibitor on.

1175
01:20:35.000 --> 01:20:36.414
Get away from me!

1176
01:20:38.049 --> 01:20:39.300
He's coming.

1177
01:20:40.144 --> 01:20:41.439
I can't control.

1178
01:20:42.200 --> 01:20:43.725
Yes. you can. Bruce! Yes. you can!

1179
01:20:43.800 --> 01:20:45.300
Get out of the building!

1180
01:20:45.504 --> 01:20:47.350
Get out of the building!

1181
01:20:47.400 --> 01:20:48.925
Get everyone out of the...

1182
01:20:52.753 --> 01:20:54.303
No! No!

1183
01:20:54.660 --> 01:20:56.319
Banner. please. Look at me.

1184
01:20:59.026 --> 01:21:01.906
No Banner. No girl.

1185
01:21:03.166 --> 01:21:04.772
Only Hulk.

1186
01:21:14.786 --> 01:21:16.535
I didn't know you could get that big.

1187
01:21:22.600 --> 01:21:24.155
Good luck with that. Peter.

1188
01:21:33.353 --> 01:21:34.619
There you are.

1189
01:21:35.800 --> 01:21:37.089
Just hold still. Just hold still...

1190
01:21:50.476 --> 01:21:51.556
God.

1191
