No lethal rounds.

1192
01:22:20.200 --> 01:22:21.836
Tracking time to detonation.

1193
01:22:51.000 --> 01:22:52.660
Ninety seconds to detonation.

1194
01:22:52.873 --> 01:22:53.953
I know! I know!

1195
01:22:59.400 --> 01:23:00.950
Come on.

1196
01:23:01.000 --> 01:23:02.357
