1197
01:23:02.600 --> 01:23:03.750
Inhibitor cannot attach.

1198
01:23:03.800 --> 01:23:04.952
Come on!

1199
01:23:43.724 --> 01:23:44.811
Dr. Banner...

1200
01:23:46.087 --> 01:23:47.117
please.

1201
01:23:49.179 --> 01:23:50.330
Bruce.

1202
01:23:51.000 --> 01:23:52.225
It's Peter.

1203
01:23:53.800 --> 01:23:55.264
I'm your friend.

1204
01:24:24.800 --> 01:24:25.857
Bruce.

1205
01:24:44.846 --> 01:24:47.626
Throw down your guns.
or you'll get the next one in the head.

1206
01:24:58.919 --> 01:25:00.305
Where is she?

1207
01:25:13.800 --> 01:25:14.905
What did you...

1208
