It's over. Jean.

1209
01:25:31.326 --> 01:25:32.388
Sara.

1210
01:25:43.622 --> 01:25:44.962
Is that my gun?

1211
01:25:53.800 --> 01:25:56.717
Is anyone hurt? It's just me?

1212
01:25:57.566 --> 01:25:59.047
Is anyone hurt?

1213
01:26:00.506 --> 01:26:01.802
Spider-Man...

1214
