by making sure she didn't find what she was looking for in there.

1217
01:26:10.600 --> 01:26:12.121
Still inside. We got her coming through.

1218
01:26:13.000 --> 01:26:15.065
Before she passed out.
she tried to say something.

1219
01:26:15.800 --> 01:26:18.793
A name. Sara.
Does that mean something to you?

1220
01:26:19.933 --> 01:26:22.034
Before you got the inhibitor on her...

1221
01:26:22.733 --> 01:26:24.927
she managed to get in my mind for a moment.

1222
01:26:26.200 --> 01:26:30.121
Sara was the name of someone I worked closely with that recently passed.

1223
01:26:30.600 --> 01:26:31.809
I'm sorry to hear that.

1224
01:26:33.000 --> 01:26:36.932
Somehow the memory of Sara must have affected her.

1225
01:26:39.800 --> 01:26:42.525
Well. I'd love to talk to her when she wakes up. if that's all right.

1226
01:26:42.600 --> 01:26:46.525
Of course. She'll be transferred to our facility on Roosevelt Island.

1227
01:26:46.726 --> 01:26:49.194
Now. I'm just as eager to get her talking as you are...

1228
01:26:49.306 --> 01:26:51.465
but let's not strain her too much in one day.

1229
01:26:51.705 --> 01:26:52.778
Yeah. of course.

1230
01:26:53.539 --> 01:26:54.829
Thank you. Spider-Man.

1231
01:26:54.955 --> 01:26:55.997
My pleasure.

1232
01:27:07.800 --> 01:27:08.850
MJ!

1233
01:27:09.000 --> 01:27:11.059
It worked. She's in custody.

1234
01:27:11.272 --> 01:27:12.619
You're safe now.

1235
