1247
01:28:29.233 --> 01:28:30.878
I was trying to protect you.

1248
01:28:31.400 --> 01:28:34.210
Yeah. well. I've almost been killed. like. five times in the past 24 hours...

1249
01:28:34.387 --> 01:28:36.230
so it's not really working that well.

1250
01:28:36.699 --> 01:28:37.976
I know. I'm sorry. I...

1251
01:28:39.480 --> 01:28:41.019
Were you ever gonna tell me?

1252
01:28:47.720 --> 01:28:48.728
Right.

1253
01:28:50.300 --> 01:28:52.874
So you just were gonna make that decision for me.

1254
01:28:53.400 --> 01:28:54.500
I know. I'm sorry.

1255
01:28:54.600 --> 01:28:56.350
I don't really need you to keep saying that you're sorry.

1256
01:28:56.600 --> 01:28:58.181
-I don't know what you want me to tell you.
-I want you to tell me...

1257
01:28:58.461 --> 01:28:59.974
why you would do this to me.

1258
01:29:05.900 --> 01:29:07.249
I lost someone.

1259
01:29:11.193 --> 01:29:13.419
And they'd still be here if it wasn't for me.

1260
01:29:18.040 --> 01:29:19.857
I didn't read you that letter because...

1261
01:29:20.873 --> 01:29:22.934
I didn't want anything like that to happen to you.

1262
01:29:23.253 --> 01:29:24.495
