1263
01:29:24.600 --> 01:29:25.995
I know it's not. but...

1264
01:29:28.280 --> 01:29:29.878
You mean everything to me.

1265
01:29:32.919 --> 01:29:35.290
And I've been trying to live my life without you. but I...

1266
01:29:37.120 --> 01:29:38.287
I can't.

1267
01:29:44.293 --> 01:29:45.514
I love you.

1268
01:29:57.513 --> 01:30:00.687
This spell or whatever it is that you did...

1269
01:30:04.426 --> 01:30:05.630
It worked.

1270
01:30:08.146 --> 01:30:11.579
All these memories that you're saying that we have together. I don't...

1271
01:30:13.659 --> 01:30:15.212
I don't have them.

1272
01:30:18.600 --> 01:30:20.583
And I do see why. you know.
she would love you...

1273
01:30:20.923 --> 01:30:23.656
the girl you wrote that letter to. but...

1274
01:30:28.300 --> 01:30:29.545
I understand...

1275
01:30:30.412 --> 01:30:33.246
that you did what you had to do to protect her.

1276
01:30:35.649 --> 01:30:38.109
And for that I'm so grateful.

1277
01:30:41.866 --> 01:30:42.940
But I...

1278
