1284
01:31:37.493 --> 01:31:38.944
Do you mind taking me home?

1285
01:31:41.793 --> 01:31:42.863
Yeah. of course.

1286
01:31:43.000 --> 01:31:44.190
Thank you.

1287
01:32:26.686 --> 01:32:28.211
-Thank you.
-Yeah. sure.

1288
01:32:29.400 --> 01:32:30.550
I'm going to...

1289
01:32:30.626 --> 01:32:32.158
Yeah. yeah. Yeah. of course.

1290
01:32:41.659 --> 01:32:43.088
Do you wanna come up?

1291
01:32:44.933 --> 01:32:46.982
Just to say hi to Ned. Maybe.

1292
01:32:50.600 --> 01:32:51.987
I would love that.

1293
01:32:52.600 --> 01:32:53.350
Okay.

1294
01:32:53.800 --> 01:32:56.664
The Hulk. a.k.a. Dr. Bruce Banner.
is in custody...

1295
01:32:57.000 --> 01:32:59.021
currently being transferred to a psychiatric ward.

1296
01:32:59.301 --> 01:33:00.321
So sad.

1297
01:33:00.533 --> 01:33:02.709
After years as a peaceful academic...

1298
01:33:02.947 --> 01:33:05.597
the question the world asked today is...

1299
01:33:05.800 --> 01:33:07.401
What finally snapped?

1300
01:33:13.553 --> 01:33:15.103
Hey. I'm nearby.

1301
01:33:15.667 --> 01:33:17.217
-Hey. I'm nearby.
-MJ?

1302
01:33:17.279 --> 01:33:19.004
-Yeah.
-Hey. I'm nearby.

1303
01:33:19.679 --> 01:33:20.950
Hey. I'm nearby.

1304
01:33:21.000 --> 01:33:22.150
You're not gonna believe this...

1305
01:33:22.274 --> 01:33:24.025
-Hey. I'm nearby.
-...but the Spidey Tracker app...

1306
01:33:24.200 --> 01:33:25.250
-...says that Spider-Man...
-Hey. I'm nearby.

1307
01:33:25.400 --> 01:33:27.417
-...is in the direct vicinity.
-Hey. I'm nearby.

1308
01:33:27.617 --> 01:33:29.230
- Yeah? No way. That's crazy.
- Hey. I'm nearby.

1309
01:33:30.016 --> 01:33:31.409
Hey. I'm nearby.

1310
01:33:32.633 --> 01:33:34.708
Ned. Spider-Man. Spider-Man. Ned.

1311
01:33:35.093 --> 01:33:36.388
It's nice to meet you. Ned.

1312
01:33:36.546 --> 01:33:37.594
Hello.

1313
01:33:38.056 --> 01:33:40.295
-I'm not. like. a weirdo or anything. I'm...
-He's a little weird.

1314
01:33:40.720 --> 01:33:43.041
Why are you here?

1315
01:33:43.630 --> 01:33:44.989
-I...
-I was...

1316
01:33:45.314 --> 01:33:47.350
-I was on a subway platform.
-She was in the... Platform. Right.

1317
01:33:47.400 --> 01:33:49.446
-And she was on her phone.
-Yeah. and... Yeah. I got a little distracted.

1318
01:33:49.634 --> 01:33:50.728
-And the train was coming and he...
-I mean...

1319
01:33:50.848 --> 01:33:51.894
And I just swooped her right up.

1320
01:33:52.141 --> 01:33:53.707
-Yep. Saved me.
-Yeah.

1321
01:33:55.400 --> 01:33:57.081
My God.

1322
01:33:58.003 --> 01:33:59.514
Why has that never happened to me?

1323
01:34:00.067 --> 01:34:03.417
So what if you're mid-swing and you decide you need to pee?

1324
01:34:03.586 --> 01:34:05.136
Do you just land on top of a building?

1325
01:34:05.400 --> 01:34:06.150
What?

1326
01:34:06.416 --> 01:34:08.500
Do you drop down to ground level and run into a coffee shop and you're like...

1327
01:34:08.600 --> 01:34:09.802
Hey. it's Spider-Man. I need to pee"?

1328
01:34:09.997 --> 01:34:11.700
Or do you find a rooftop somewhere?

1329
01:34:11.860 --> 01:34:13.610
No. I don't find a rooftop somewhere. Ned.

1330
01:34:13.800 --> 01:34:15.638
Is this really what you wanna be asking him right now?

1331
01:34:15.800 --> 01:34:17.401
Yeah. dude. come on.
you can ask me anything.

1332
01:34:17.426 --> 01:34:18.999
You wanna know how my web shooters work?

1333
01:34:19.066 --> 01:34:20.659
I mean. I already know how the web shooters work.

1334
01:34:20.873 --> 01:34:21.998
Is that right?

1335
01:34:22.023 --> 01:34:24.990
Well. there's obviously some sort of a shear-thinning fluid...

1336
01:34:25.117 --> 01:34:28.656
that is cycling within a chamber. right? So it can keep its liquid form.

1337
01:34:28.760 --> 01:34:31.213
And then. when you activate it by pressing on the triggers...

1338
01:34:31.400 --> 01:34:32.786
it runs through a Teflon turbine...

1339
01:34:32.893 --> 01:34:36.450
and then it hardens when it interacts with the air. Right?

1340
01:34:39.675 --> 01:34:41.561
I mean. not exactly. but...

1341
01:34:41.680 --> 01:34:43.781
Okay. okay. well. then tell me what's in the web fluid.

1342
01:34:44.061 --> 01:34:47.054
I would guess something like a long chain polymer.

1343
01:34:47.766 --> 01:34:48.575
Nylon?

1344
01:34:48.600 --> 01:34:49.586
That's pretty close.

1345
01:34:49.640 --> 01:34:53.032
Okay. okay. What about Nomex or Kevlar?

1346
01:34:55.201 --> 01:34:57.112
All right. then. Keep your secrets.

1347
01:34:57.493 --> 01:35:00.143
If you're referring to the incident with the dragon...

1348
01:35:00.168 --> 01:35:01.584
I was barely involved.

1349
01:35:01.800 --> 01:35:05.204
All I did was simply give your uncle a little nudge out the door.

1350
01:35:07.866 --> 01:35:09.238
Solid reference.

1351
01:35:10.706 --> 01:35:12.046
Banh mi time.

1352
01:35:12.200 --> 01:35:13.276
You ordered banh mis?

1353
01:35:13.502 --> 01:35:14.627
I ordered five banh mis.

1354
01:35:14.686 --> 01:35:16.586
We have Spider-Man in the apartment.
He's gonna get fed.

1355
01:35:20.326 --> 01:35:23.326
Sorry about him. He's just. like. very excited that you're here.

1356
01:35:23.453 --> 01:35:25.875
You kidding? This is. like. the most fun I've had in years.

1357
01:35:26.453 --> 01:35:27.919
I really missed you guys.

1358
01:35:29.913 --> 01:35:31.763
You guys really do look like best friends.

1359
01:35:31.973 --> 01:35:33.235
What do you mean?

1360
01:35:42.600 --> 01:35:43.717
You should tell him.

1361
01:35:44.200 --> 01:35:45.536
He can handle it.

1362
01:35:47.099 --> 01:35:48.283
Yeah. I know.

1363
01:35:55.226 --> 01:35:58.679
When she was inhabiting you on the rooftop...

1364
01:35:59.993 --> 01:36:01.282
she kissed me...

1365
01:36:02.200 --> 01:36:03.750
and I kissed her back...

1366
01:36:03.873 --> 01:36:06.523
because I thought it was you.
but I didn't know.

1367
01:36:07.158 --> 01:36:09.009
And I'm really sorry.

1368
01:36:10.259 --> 01:36:11.868
I just thought you should know.

1369
01:36:14.019 --> 01:36:15.329
Thanks for telling me.

1370
01:36:18.653 --> 01:36:21.436
I mean. it's not like I remember anything anyway. so...

1371
01:36:23.025 --> 01:36:23.911
Really?

1372
01:36:24.020 --> 01:36:26.670
Yeah. It was weird. it was like.
one second I was sitting at my desk....

1373
01:36:27.000 --> 01:36:28.905
and the next second I was lying on the street.

1374
01:36:29.507 --> 01:36:31.418
I don't know. like a light switch went off.

1375
01:36:33.920 --> 01:36:34.706
What?

1376
01:36:34.800 --> 01:36:36.419
So you don't remember anything?

1377
01:36:38.359 --> 01:36:39.409
No. Why?

1378
01:36:39.615 --> 01:36:42.328
Metzger said he remembered thinking about someone named Sara...

1379
01:36:42.414 --> 01:36:45.644
but what you're saying is that you don't remember anything at all?

1380
01:36:47.690 --> 01:36:49.803
I mean. yeah. it was instantaneous.

1381
01:36:50.200 --> 01:36:51.630
That's what made it so scary.

1382
01:36:53.400 --> 01:36:54.662
He lied to me.

1383
01:36:57.634 --> 01:36:59.250
I heard you caught leshy.

1384
01:36:59.400 --> 01:37:00.500
Yeah. Her name's Jean Grey.

1385
01:37:00.600 --> 01:37:02.925
I need some help determining the size of some potatoes.

1386
01:37:03.000 --> 01:37:04.825
-Potatoes?
-I think that's Black Widow.

1387
01:37:05.000 --> 01:37:06.850
I think Metzger lied to me about a name.

1388
01:37:07.000 --> 01:37:10.499
Can you see if there's a connection between Jean and someone named Sara?

1389
01:37:11.606 --> 01:37:13.479
These potatoes sound meager.

1390
01:37:15.226 --> 01:37:16.931
Wow. That really is your office.

1391
01:37:17.433 --> 01:37:18.500
Well. well. well.

1392
01:37:18.600 --> 01:37:20.950
Internet. government records...

1393
01:37:21.000 --> 01:37:25.525
and a lot of data related to Jean Grey has been scrubbed by Damage Control.

1394
01:37:26.046 --> 01:37:27.332
Data about what?

1395
01:37:27.926 --> 01:37:29.172
Her sister.

1396
01:37:29.572 --> 01:37:31.078
Wait. Jean has a sister?

1397
01:37:33.800 --> 01:37:34.879
Sara Grey.

1398
01:37:35.000 --> 01:37:36.372
Also a telepath.

1399
01:37:36.460 --> 01:37:40.010
Damage Control took her into custody for study and observation.

1400
01:37:40.275 --> 01:37:42.461
Wow. I mean. you can probably guess what they mean by that.

1401
01:37:42.661 --> 01:37:44.850
Experimentation and other human rights violations.

1402
01:37:45.000 --> 01:37:46.744
Yes. exactly. Wait. who are you?

1403
01:37:46.924 --> 01:37:48.500
-Hi. Ned Leeds. Big fan.
-I'm...

1404
01:37:48.894 --> 01:37:50.028
Hi.

1405
01:37:50.088 --> 01:37:51.134
I'm sorry.

1406
01:37:51.632 --> 01:37:54.705
I'm just so happy that the sad man has friends.

1407
01:37:56.860 --> 01:37:59.121
Thanks. I owe you one.

1408
01:38:00.200 --> 01:38:01.391
Good luck. Spider-Man.

1409
01:38:01.525 --> 01:38:02.575
Bye.

1410
01:38:02.600 --> 01:38:04.125
She was just looking for her sister...

1411
01:38:04.200 --> 01:38:06.243
and I handed her to the people that took her.

1412
01:38:06.600 --> 01:38:07.951
-I gotta go.
-Hey. Peter...

1413
01:38:08.132 --> 01:38:09.144
Yeah?

1414
01:38:10.200 --> 01:38:11.486
Just be careful. all right?

1415
01:38:13.119 --> 01:38:14.301
Yeah. I will.

1416
01:38:19.000 --> 01:38:20.645
Spider-Man's name is Peter?

1417
01:38:34.260 --> 01:38:36.481
Jean. who do you want to be?

1418
01:38:39.039 --> 01:38:40.678
Her. Pink jacket.

1419
01:38:42.068 --> 01:38:43.261
She's too far.

1420
01:38:44.266 --> 01:38:45.395
You're gonna have to hop.

1421
01:38:45.493 --> 01:38:46.589
Hop?

1422
01:38:46.786 --> 01:38:48.737
First. pick someone close.

1423
01:38:49.653 --> 01:38:50.843
And then...

1424
01:39:04.646 --> 01:39:05.969
Each hop has a limit.

1425
01:39:06.253 --> 01:39:09.353
But you can string them together and go as far as you want.

1426
01:39:10.039 --> 01:39:11.533
And when you let go...

1427
01:39:12.600 --> 01:39:14.168
You're right back where you started.

1428
01:39:15.139 --> 01:39:17.464
Could you do that to everyone in this park at once?

1429
01:39:18.386 --> 01:39:19.908
Well. yeah. maybe one day.

1430
01:39:20.487 --> 01:39:21.834
If you get really good.

1431
01:39:35.216 --> 01:39:36.496
How could she just...

1432
01:39:37.400 --> 01:39:38.578
send us away?

1433
01:39:40.159 --> 01:39:41.626
She wasn't really a mom.

1434
01:39:43.725 --> 01:39:44.831
Not like that. anyway.

1435
01:39:44.878 --> 01:39:46.957
She was. before we changed.

1436
01:39:47.233 --> 01:39:48.752
Yeah. well. if that's all it takes for you to stop being a mom...

1437
01:39:48.839 --> 01:39:50.052
then you're not a mom.

1438
01:39:50.806 --> 01:39:52.971
What would you do if you had daughters like us?

1439
01:39:53.400 --> 01:39:54.511
I'd love them.

1440
01:39:58.200 --> 01:39:59.951
-Especially the redhead one.
-Shut up.

1441
01:40:02.600 --> 01:40:03.908
We have each other.

1442
01:40:07.800 --> 01:40:09.197
And we have ice cream.

1443
01:40:11.233 --> 01:40:12.779
-One mint chip. one chocolate?
-Yeah.

1444
01:40:19.106 --> 01:40:20.123
Okay.

1445
01:40:21.500 --> 01:40:23.125
Now I know how you're playing.

1446
01:40:40.600 --> 01:40:41.596
-Get down!
-Get down!

1447
01:40:41.739 --> 01:40:43.023
-Get down! Get down!
-Get down! Get down!

1448
01:40:43.294 --> 01:40:45.014
-Get down on the ground now!
-Get down! Get down!

1449
01:40:47.350 --> 01:40:48.590
-Down!
-Sara!

1450
01:40:54.200 --> 01:40:55.521
I'm sorry. Jean.

1451
01:40:56.378 --> 01:40:57.974
I have to keep you safe.

1452
01:41:40.366 --> 01:41:43.552
Subject is awake. Heart rate is 94 bpm.

1453
01:41:46.200 --> 01:41:49.699
Jean. that's not gonna work anymore. thanks to Spider-Man.

1454
01:41:53.459 --> 01:41:54.609
Jean?

1455
01:42:03.800 --> 01:42:04.950
I need you to breathe.

1456
01:42:05.000 --> 01:42:06.919
I need you to look at me and breathe.

1457
01:42:07.400 --> 01:42:08.425
Okay?

1458
01:42:08.600 --> 01:42:10.224
You're safe. Breathe.

1459
01:42:12.739 --> 01:42:14.012
Where is she?

1460
01:42:15.314 --> 01:42:17.164
Like your sister.
you've been blessed with a power...

1461
01:42:17.286 --> 01:42:20.099
that has the potential to do tremendous good in the world...

1462
01:42:20.852 --> 01:42:22.132
or tremendous damage.

1463
01:42:23.126 --> 01:42:27.076
A power like yours in the hands of a child is an impossible burden.

1464
01:42:27.899 --> 01:42:29.081
But imagine...

1465
01:42:30.067 --> 01:42:32.220
if that power was placed
in the hands of people...

1466
01:42:32.528 --> 01:42:34.121
who actually know what to do with it.

1467
01:42:42.939 --> 01:42:44.701
Where is my sister?

1468
01:42:47.586 --> 01:42:49.486
You're gonna change the world. Jean.

1469
01:42:49.946 --> 01:42:51.046
Hey!

1470
01:42:51.660 --> 01:42:52.825
Hey!

1471
01:43:14.520 --> 01:43:15.554
Frank.

1472
01:43:15.734 --> 01:43:17.640
I know where you are. what you're doing.

1473
01:43:17.859 --> 01:43:19.213
Yeah? And how's that?

1474
01:43:19.447 --> 01:43:20.847
I got eyes everywhere. kid.

1475
01:43:22.360 --> 01:43:24.742
Look. Frank.
Damage Control kidnapped Jean's sister.

1476
01:43:25.000 --> 01:43:27.477
Jean was just trying to find her.
We were wrong about everything.

1477
01:43:27.800 --> 01:43:29.203
Sentimental horseshit.

1478
01:43:29.959 --> 01:43:32.036
You've seen what she can do and what she's capable of.

1479
01:43:32.200 --> 01:43:34.962
What. you're gonna let her loose? Is that what you're gonna do?

1480
01:43:35.886 --> 01:43:39.464
I'll tell you right now. you do that.
I handle it my way.

1481
01:43:39.947 --> 01:43:41.506
Frank. please. can you just...

1482
01:43:41.653 --> 01:43:42.906
Frank!

1483
01:43:55.499 --> 01:43:56.554
Distance check?

1484
01:43:56.974 --> 01:43:58.075
Forty-foot clearance.

1485
01:43:58.100 --> 01:43:59.345
Locking down the room.

1486
01:43:59.487 --> 01:44:00.551
Locking down.

1487
01:44:05.749 --> 01:44:07.182
Disengage inhibitor.

1488
01:44:11.206 --> 01:44:13.454
Jean. your powers are now fully operational.

1489
01:44:22.900 --> 01:44:25.706
As you can tell.
we are beyond your jump radius.

1490
01:44:27.153 --> 01:44:28.790
Tell me what V-Max is.

1491
01:44:29.292 --> 01:44:31.922
You're the second person to ask me about that.
WEBSITE - HDHUB4U.AG

1492
01:44:32.300 --> 01:44:33.804
I have no idea what that means.

1493
01:44:33.960 --> 01:44:35.843
She sent me a message.

1494
01:44:36.286 --> 01:44:38.025
She was trying to help me find her.

1495
01:44:38.892 --> 01:44:42.386
She communicated with you telepathically across all that distance?

1496
01:44:42.780 --> 01:44:45.831
We did register a huge spike in that session.

1497
01:44:47.966 --> 01:44:48.901
Fascinating

1498
01:44:48.953 --> 01:44:51.083
What does it mean?

1499
01:44:52.699 --> 01:44:54.084
I don't know.

1500
01:44:54.786 --> 01:44:56.119
Let's begin.

1501
01:45:04.325 --> 01:45:06.667
Our work with Sara centered on two areas...

1502
01:45:06.827 --> 01:45:08.802
identifying the source of her power...

1503
01:45:08.873 --> 01:45:11.598
and identifying a path towards copying it.

1504
01:45:12.199 --> 01:45:15.891
If we could find a way to record a telepathic brain during a jump...

1505
01:45:16.330 --> 01:45:18.931
then perhaps we could replicate those pathways...

1506
01:45:19.120 --> 01:45:20.872
in a mind of our choosing.

1507
01:45:22.293 --> 01:45:25.444
This instrument is your sister's legacy.

1508
01:45:26.526 --> 01:45:29.419
We built this together over many months of trial and error.

1509
01:45:30.726 --> 01:45:32.966
I hope you and I can honor her sacrifice.

1510
01:45:36.066 --> 01:45:37.672
What are you talking about?

1511
01:45:38.900 --> 01:45:40.180
Trigger the first jump.

1512
01:45:44.880 --> 01:45:47.409
Tell me what V-Max is.

1513
01:45:47.660 --> 01:45:49.437
I know that's where you're hiding her.

1514
01:46:00.413 --> 01:46:02.620
SCANNING

1515
01:46:04.406 --> 01:46:05.701
She's jumping.

1516
01:46:07.713 --> 01:46:08.762
Copy.

1517
01:46:09.167 --> 01:46:11.892
We're in full lockdown.
Process has commenced.

1518
01:46:12.200 --> 01:46:13.270
What process?

1519
01:46:14.600 --> 01:46:16.950
Hey. whoa.
that's a pretty serious look there. dude.

1520
01:46:17.800 --> 01:46:19.300
Hey. hey. whoa! What the hell. man?

1521
01:46:19.419 --> 01:46:21.825
Come on. I'm a friend of Damage Control. What are you doin'?

1522
01:46:26.200 --> 01:46:27.943
It's gonna be like that. You wanna go.

1523
01:46:28.359 --> 01:46:29.289
All right.

1524
01:46:29.400 --> 01:46:30.982
All right. well. just give me a sec.

1525
01:46:31.400 --> 01:46:32.655
Give me a sec.

1526
01:46:33.106 --> 01:46:34.788
I'm not in high school anymore.

1527
01:46:37.000 --> 01:46:38.509
Do you stretch? You a big stretcher?

1528
01:46:38.600 --> 01:46:40.389
I mean. you should do it in your line of work.

1529
01:46:40.660 --> 01:46:43.688
What about you? You guys stretch?
It's so good for you.

1530
01:46:45.493 --> 01:46:46.562
You ready?

1531
01:46:55.800 --> 01:46:57.001
Watch your head!

1532
01:47:16.820 --> 01:47:18.520
Where is Jean Grey?

1533
01:47:19.983 --> 01:47:21.375
That's jump 26.

1534
01:47:21.406 --> 01:47:22.491
Recordings look good.

1535
01:47:22.600 --> 01:47:23.951
Excuse me. sir.

1536
01:47:24.793 --> 01:47:26.231
We have an intruder.

1537
01:47:31.000 --> 01:47:32.364
You were right.

1538
01:47:32.619 --> 01:47:34.610
She's much stronger than her sister.

1539
01:47:35.400 --> 01:47:36.832
Increase the frequency.

1540
01:47:38.007 --> 01:47:39.480
You're doing very well. Jean.

1541
01:47:41.079 --> 01:47:42.681
SCANNING.

1542
01:48:27.400 --> 01:48:28.569
Jean?

1543
01:48:33.000 --> 01:48:34.448
Jean. can you hear me?

1544
01:48:40.713 --> 01:48:41.961
Jean?

1545
01:48:46.200 --> 01:48:47.717
You're a murderer.

1546
01:48:49.800 --> 01:48:52.525
Her frequencies are evolving.

1547
01:48:53.086 --> 01:48:54.578
This doesn't make sense.

1548
01:48:55.093 --> 01:48:59.316
The last thing my sister saw was this room.

1549
01:48:59.559 --> 01:49:02.299
Her brainwaves are somehow affecting the objects around her.

1550
01:49:02.386 --> 01:49:03.306
Shut it down.

1551
01:49:03.499 --> 01:49:04.452
I'm trying. sir.

1552
01:49:04.559 --> 01:49:05.650
What do you mean you're trying?

1553
01:49:05.850 --> 01:49:11.033
The last thing my sister saw was this goddamn room!

1554
01:49:11.213 --> 01:49:13.370
-Shut it down!
-I can't. sir.

1555
01:49:14.626 --> 01:49:15.883
Move.

1556
01:49:17.553 --> 01:49:19.593
I can't let you do that. Bill.

1557
01:49:23.160 --> 01:49:27.110
The only hands that will wield this power...

1558
01:49:28.320 --> 01:49:29.720
are mine.

1559
01:51:42.526 --> 01:51:44.141
-What...
-What do you want?

1560
01:51:47.653 --> 01:51:50.459
Jean. I'm here to help you.

1561
01:51:51.927 --> 01:51:53.307
You put me here.

1562
01:51:53.973 --> 01:51:57.923
I know. and I'm sorry about Sara.
and I'm sorry that I got it so wrong.

1563
01:52:00.382 --> 01:52:01.314
If you came here...

1564
01:52:01.353 --> 01:52:04.503
to save a helpless girl from Damage Control.
you're too late.

1565
01:52:05.620 --> 01:52:07.351
They're the ones who need saving.

1566
01:52:07.853 --> 01:52:09.064
And now...

1567
01:52:09.400 --> 01:52:10.631
so do you.

1568
01:52:13.079 --> 01:52:14.158
Here we go.

1569
01:52:28.600 --> 01:52:29.934
God. that's cool.

1570
01:52:51.000 --> 01:52:52.925
Jean! Jean. please!

1571
01:53:07.233 --> 01:53:08.925
Come on! Come on! Come on!

1572
01:53:29.442 --> 01:53:30.550
What?

1573
01:53:32.400 --> 01:53:33.433
Isn't it funny...

1574
01:53:33.553 --> 01:53:37.066
how your friends from Damage Control developed a special weapon...

1575
01:53:37.200 --> 01:53:38.350
just for you?

1576
01:53:39.600 --> 01:53:41.975
They've got a whole task force ready.

1577
01:53:42.540 --> 01:53:44.421
Just in case you ever get out of line.

1578
01:53:49.026 --> 01:53:50.383
People are monsters.

1579
01:53:55.372 --> 01:53:58.516
You shouldn't trust them any more than they trust you.

1580
01:54:12.000 --> 01:54:12.981
I'm a little busy. Frank.

1581
01:54:13.200 --> 01:54:14.480
We got a problem. kid.

1582
01:54:14.626 --> 01:54:17.375
She got ahold of everyone within a kilometer of the island.

1583
01:54:18.153 --> 01:54:19.235
Wait. what?

1584
01:54:24.950 --> 01:54:27.217
Hey. look. if you're gonna do something. you better do it now.

1585
01:54:27.346 --> 01:54:28.583
I'm trying!

1586
01:54:53.926 --> 01:54:55.076
Kid?

1587
01:54:55.473 --> 01:54:57.423
Shit! Goddamn it.

1588
01:55:31.060 --> 01:55:32.324
My sister died...

1589
01:55:32.400 --> 01:55:33.644
in this room...

1590
01:55:35.013 --> 01:55:36.780
surrounded by these men.

1591
01:55:37.940 --> 01:55:39.135
And her only crime...

1592
01:55:39.200 --> 01:55:40.682
was that she was special.

1593
01:55:42.646 --> 01:55:43.752
Just like you.

1594
01:55:45.260 --> 01:55:46.438
Just like me.

1595
01:55:49.126 --> 01:55:52.256
People like us don't get to live a normal life.

1596
01:55:55.020 --> 01:55:58.314
We don't get to have friends or a family.

1597
01:56:00.366 --> 01:56:01.762
Those people are gone.

1598
01:56:04.473 --> 01:56:06.288
That life is over.

1599
01:56:32.319 --> 01:56:34.654
So why don't you just be honest with yourself?

1600
01:56:37.686 --> 01:56:39.280
Are you Peter Parker?

1601
01:56:41.260 --> 01:56:42.661
Or are you Spider-Man?

1602
01:57:15.600 --> 01:57:16.697
I'm both.

1603
01:59:01.253 --> 01:59:03.053
Jean. please.

1604
01:59:04.599 --> 01:59:06.185
This won't make it right.

1605
01:59:08.175 --> 01:59:09.975
Come on. You're not a killer. Jean.

1606
01:59:10.000 --> 01:59:11.453
You have no idea what I am.

1607
01:59:13.200 --> 01:59:14.909
I know that you loved your sister.

1608
01:59:18.313 --> 01:59:21.063
And I know that losing her felt like you'd lost everything.

1609
01:59:21.200 --> 01:59:24.087
If you come any closer. he dies! They all do!

1610
01:59:42.400 --> 01:59:43.889
You know this won't bring her back. right. Jean?

1611
01:59:44.000 --> 01:59:44.909
You...

1612
02:00:01.720 --> 02:00:03.870
Don't be so sure I can't get into your mind.

1613
02:00:05.799 --> 02:00:08.014
I'm a lot more powerful since I last tried.

1614
02:00:18.033 --> 02:00:19.301
Go ahead.

1615
02:00:28.500 --> 02:00:29.660
Hey.

1616
02:00:30.906 --> 02:00:32.149
Hey.

1617
02:00:34.140 --> 02:00:37.765
You think you don't have to listen to me now that you've got powers?

1618
02:00:42.700 --> 02:00:47.975
You know. this whole thing can get really scary.

1619
02:00:48.659 --> 02:00:50.001
You know that?

1620
02:01:07.853 --> 02:01:09.522
It's already pretty scary.

1621
02:01:10.853 --> 02:01:12.003
Yeah.

1622
02:01:12.313 --> 02:01:15.013
And things can change. like. very quickly...

1623
02:01:15.419 --> 02:01:18.144
in ways that we can't even imagine right now.

1624
02:01:18.580 --> 02:01:19.452
I know.

1625
02:01:19.600 --> 02:01:20.572
No.

1626
02:01:23.706 --> 02:01:25.344
I don't think you do know.

1627
02:01:26.979 --> 02:01:28.429
What do you mean?

1628
02:01:31.666 --> 02:01:33.321
You're a really special person.

1629
02:01:34.986 --> 02:01:38.478
And I would hope that that will always make you feel really great about yourself...

1630
02:01:38.920 --> 02:01:41.489
but I know sometimes it doesn't.

1631
02:01:41.920 --> 02:01:44.423
Sometimes you'll be really lonely.

1632
02:01:47.986 --> 02:01:49.314
And sometimes...

1633
02:01:50.492 --> 02:01:52.188
because you're special...

1634
02:01:54.373 --> 02:01:58.081
people can do dark. monstrous things to you.

1635
02:02:00.340 --> 02:02:01.406
But...

1636
02:02:02.906 --> 02:02:04.488
this is what I want you to know.

1637
02:02:06.373 --> 02:02:07.657
You're beautiful...

1638
02:02:08.241 --> 02:02:09.741
and the people who love you...

1639
02:02:09.766 --> 02:02:13.466
we love you not because you're special.
we love you because you're you.

1640
02:02:15.853 --> 02:02:17.437
I want you to remember that.

1641
02:02:19.439 --> 02:02:21.511
Even when it feels like you're totally alone.

1642
02:02:24.480 --> 02:02:26.499
That's your deepest responsibility.

1643
02:02:29.659 --> 02:02:32.686
Never forget that.
no matter how powerful you become.

1644
02:02:49.106 --> 02:02:50.102
Hey.

1645
02:03:05.946 --> 02:03:07.882
I'm sorry about your sister.

1646
02:03:12.840 --> 02:03:14.400
I'm sorry about your aunt.

1647
02:03:18.039 --> 02:03:19.640
Yeah. you would've loved her.

1648
02:03:23.100 --> 02:03:25.057
Just because we've lost someone...

1649
02:03:28.186 --> 02:03:30.209
It doesn't mean we have to do this alone.

1650
02:03:32.273 --> 02:03:34.923
I mean. we can't.

1651
02:03:35.247 --> 02:03:36.978
Trust me. I've been trying.

1652
02:03:40.224 --> 02:03:41.551
It doesn't work.

1653
02:03:46.106 --> 02:03:47.615
Even if that's true...

1654
02:03:51.773 --> 02:03:53.294
I have no one.

1655
02:03:57.600 --> 02:03:59.012
You have me.

1656
02:04:43.200 --> 02:04:44.327
Are you hurt?

1657
02:04:44.696 --> 02:04:46.069
No. I'm fine.

1658
02:04:51.673 --> 02:04:53.120
I'm okay.

1659
02:04:53.600 --> 02:04:55.002
-Peter.
-I'm okay. I'm okay. I'm okay.

1660
02:04:55.173 --> 02:04:56.621
Peter. No.

1661
02:05:00.273 --> 02:05:01.755
Peter. Peter. No. no.

1662
02:05:02.400 --> 02:05:04.348
No. no. no. Peter. Peter.

1663
02:05:05.400 --> 02:05:07.755
Jean. you gotta get outta here.
They'll be looking for you.

1664
02:05:08.000 --> 02:05:09.575
No. no. no. Please. just stay with me.

1665
02:05:09.669 --> 02:05:10.848
Come on. hold on. Come on. please!

1666
02:05:10.952 --> 02:05:12.168
Jean. you're...

1667
02:05:13.200 --> 02:05:14.592
You're gonna be okay.

1668
02:05:15.919 --> 02:05:16.886
Just go.

1669
02:05:19.200 --> 02:05:20.325
Look at me.

1670
02:05:37.846 --> 02:05:42.896
Shock today. as Spider-Man arrived at Bellevue Hospital with a bullet wound

1671
02:05:43.146 --> 02:05:44.851
seemingly at death's door.

1672
02:05:47.130 --> 02:05:49.847
The reclusive crime fighter is in critical condition

1673
02:05:49.872 --> 02:05:52.874
as the city's top medical experts work to save him.

1674
02:05:56.206 --> 02:05:59.047
Tonight. all eyes are on Spider-Man.

1675
02:06:01.026 --> 02:06:03.582
The hero who saved New York so many times

1676
02:06:04.000 --> 02:06:06.536
is now in the hands of its best and brightest.

1677
02:06:08.800 --> 02:06:11.617
And the people of New York hold their breath.

1678
02:07:18.713 --> 02:07:19.774
Frank?

1679
02:07:23.139 --> 02:07:24.311
Where am I?

1680
02:07:26.251 --> 02:07:28.601
-No. no. no. Hey.
-Where's my mask?

1681
02:07:28.626 --> 02:07:30.018
Don't worry about that. I got you covered.

1682
02:07:30.106 --> 02:07:31.418
Hey. you're good.

1683
02:07:31.600 --> 02:07:32.928
Where's Jean? Is she okay?

1684
02:07:32.986 --> 02:07:34.911
Yeah. she's okay. She's okay.

1685
02:07:35.033 --> 02:07:36.392
-Where is she?
-Kid.

1686
02:07:37.600 --> 02:07:39.120
I think maybe she just left.

1687
02:07:40.400 --> 02:07:45.056
She was using her magic voodoo shit to keep you alive.

1688
02:07:46.580 --> 02:07:48.904
Yeah... she's all right.

1689
02:07:55.772 --> 02:07:57.114
I'm sorry.

1690
02:08:01.421 --> 02:08:04.521
-Frank. Frank. it's okay.
-Just... I'm really sorry for what I did.

1691
02:08:04.546 --> 02:08:06.329
-No. Frank. it's okay.
-And it's. no. it's a lot of things...

1692
02:08:06.506 --> 02:08:08.509
but it sure as shit ain't okay. all right?

1693
02:08:12.000 --> 02:08:13.230
I've seen...

1694
02:08:14.886 --> 02:08:18.633
I've seen real bravery. kid. in my day.

1695
02:08:20.253 --> 02:08:21.394
But that...

1696
02:08:22.606 --> 02:08:24.176
that was something else.

1697
02:08:27.440 --> 02:08:28.547
You crying. Frank?

1698
02:08:28.873 --> 02:08:30.440
No. I ain't...

1699
02:08:37.247 --> 02:08:39.691
You know. you look the exact way I thought you would.

1700
02:08:40.366 --> 02:08:41.430
You know.

1701
02:08:41.732 --> 02:08:42.983
A nice kid.

1702
02:08:45.273 --> 02:08:46.793
Never had a friend like that.

1703
02:08:48.446 --> 02:08:49.894
Are we friends now?

1704
02:08:56.978 --> 02:08:58.511
I can't believe I just saw you cry.

1705
02:08:58.593 --> 02:09:00.544
I didn't cry. What are you talking about?

1706
02:09:00.953 --> 02:09:02.078
Bullshit.

1707
02:09:04.000 --> 02:09:05.525
Yeah. this.

1708
02:09:05.760 --> 02:09:07.429
They've been doing it all night.

1709
02:09:07.693 --> 02:09:10.443
They've been here since you walked in.
Just take a look.

1710
02:09:20.800 --> 02:09:23.697
Yo. kid. when you came in.
they had to cut through the suit...

1711
02:09:23.833 --> 02:09:25.937
but when you're ready to split...

1712
02:09:27.172 --> 02:09:28.436
I got a plan

1713
02:09:30.107 --> 02:09:32.342
Dr. Moseley. 2495.

1714
02:09:32.716 --> 02:09:34.552
Dr. Moseley. 2495.

1715
02:09:50.066 --> 02:09:52.265
Hey. it's Spider-Man!

1716
02:09:54.619 --> 02:09:55.752
Spider-Man!

1717
02:09:59.813 --> 02:10:00.953
Hey!

1718
02:10:03.600 --> 02:10:04.886
Yeah. Spider-Man!

1719
02:10:06.400 --> 02:10:08.042
You're the best. Spider-Man!

1720
02:10:09.200 --> 02:10:10.437
Spider-Man!

1721
02:10:12.106 --> 02:10:13.285
Over here!

1722
02:10:14.400 --> 02:10:15.636
We love you!

1723
02:10:49.722 --> 02:10:53.791
Spider-Man! Spider-Man! Spider-Man!

1724
02:11:09.160 --> 02:11:13.085
Spider-Man! Spider-Man! Spider-Man!

1725
02:12:23.038 --> 02:12:24.264
I've...

1726
02:12:27.133 --> 02:12:29.214
Been thinking a lot about what you said.

1727
02:12:31.600 --> 02:12:34.591
And you'd be happy to know that I've decided I'm not...

1728
02:12:36.000 --> 02:12:38.061
I'm not gonna do this alone anymore.

1729
02:12:47.493 --> 02:12:48.833
I miss you. May.

1730
02:12:57.167 --> 02:12:59.149
I mean. I've still got a little pain in my back...

1731
02:12:59.240 --> 02:13:02.195
but I could probably get back out there if you need me for anything.

1732
02:13:02.464 --> 02:13:04.559
What I need you to do is rest.

1733
02:13:04.800 --> 02:13:06.669
I know. I know. but come on.
you gotta give me something.

1734
02:13:06.772 --> 02:13:08.622
I mean. how's the investigation going?

1735
02:13:08.886 --> 02:13:11.721
Well. Metzger's still missing. but...

1736
02:13:12.319 --> 02:13:14.221
your friend. Black Widow...

1737
02:13:14.400 --> 02:13:16.909
she's been helping us dig through all the records...

1738
02:13:17.159 --> 02:13:19.281
Damage Control tried to have scrubbed.

1739
02:13:19.826 --> 02:13:22.151
Had me drop by her office the other day.

1740
02:13:22.259 --> 02:13:23.431
And how was that?

1741
02:13:23.879 --> 02:13:26.293
Well. my skin feels amazing.

1742
02:13:27.860 --> 02:13:31.074
Attention. all units.
We have a confirmed bank robbery in progress.

1743
02:13:31.319 --> 02:13:32.700
Hey. are you getting this?

1744
02:13:34.121 --> 02:13:35.141
Yeah. I'm on it.

1745
02:13:35.166 --> 02:13:37.416
Hey. it's not that far from me.
I could probably meet you down there.

1746
02:13:37.620 --> 02:13:39.942
No. We can handle a robbery.

1747
02:13:40.839 --> 02:13:43.523
Just try to take care of yourself.

1748
02:13:45.279 --> 02:13:46.338
Okay.

1749
02:13:47.726 --> 02:13:48.744
You too.

1750
02:13:49.600 --> 02:13:51.466
Say hello to EJ and Marley for me.

1751
02:13:52.709 --> 02:13:53.722
Okay.

1752
02:13:55.600 --> 02:13:57.306
Spider-Man says hello.

1753
02:14:33.752 --> 02:14:34.816
Hi.

1754
02:14:34.841 --> 02:14:36.323
Hey.

1755
02:14:39.613 --> 02:14:41.755
Flower guy. right from the party?

1756
02:14:43.206 --> 02:14:44.691
I'm Peter.

1757
02:14:45.525 --> 02:14:47.016
Okay. Hello.

1758
02:15:05.435 --> 02:15:06.661
Peter
